 one action JSON on the last line.","reply":"```python\ndef transform(grid):\n    h, w = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    mark = next(v for row in grid for v in row if v not in (0, 6))\n    seed = [(r, c) for r in range(h) for c in range(w) if grid[r][c] == mark]\n    rmin, cmin = min(r for r, c in seed), min(c for r, c in seed)\n    shape = [(r-rmin, c-cmin) for r, c in seed]\n    dh, dw = max(r for r, c in shape), max(c for r, c in shape)\n    out = [row[:] for row in grid]\n\n    for r in range(h-dh):\n        for c in range(w-dw):\n            cells = [(r+dr, c+dc) for dr, dc in shape]\n            if all(grid[y][x] == 0 for y, x in cells):\n                for y, x in cells:\n                    out[y][x] = mark\n    return out\n```\n{\"action\": \"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit"}}]}